      "message": "test: Extract and use sigterm_node in init_fd_overflow_test\n\nChanges:\n\n* Extract a shared get_process_group_kwargs() to avoid repeating it\n* In sigterm_node, use node.wait_until_stopped() instead of the manual\n  assert_equal(0, node.process.wait())\n* Extract sigterm_node; can be reviewed via the git options\n  --color-moved=dimmed-zebra --color-moved-ws=ignore-all-space\n* Use self.sigterm_node(node)+get_process_group_kwargs() over\n  node.kill_process() for a graceful shutdown to avoid complaints from\n  the llvm-symbolizer about a broken pipe when it resolves UBSAN\n  suppressions during a process kill",
