      "body": "ACK fad49a733d611f6d49ab9cb80509b79af500b384\n\nI could not reproduce the failure: it needs a sanitizer build, and I tested on macOS without one. feature_init.py passed 5 of 5 runs with and without the change. With a startup warning added to the node, init_fd_overflow_test still fails on the unexpected stderr, so the clean stop hides nothing. The stress test now also checks stderr after each SIGTERM, which it did not before.\n\nThe same failure hit the ASan job on three of my PRs, #36185, #36407 and #36409, on 2026-10-01 and 2026-10-02: [1](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/36920413991/job/110564763097), [2](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/36928942246/job/110593132751), [3](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/36976685203/job/110741924995).\n",
